    "description_html": "<p>Elevate your brand with our Metal Reusable Window Badges, designed to combine durability, functionality, and cost-effectiveness. Perfect for businesses, events, and organizations, these badges offer a sleek and professional look.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits of Metal Reusable Window Badges</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Real Metal Front</strong>: Each badge features a real metal front paired with a black plastic back, providing a sturdy and professional appearance.</li>\n<li><strong>Complimentary Reusable Name Badge Card Inserts</strong>: Shipped with free reusable name badge card inserts, ensuring you have everything you need with each order.</li>\n<li><strong>Economical to Use</strong>: Our A4 sheets of pre-perforated card inserts are compatible with your existing printer, whether inkjet, laser, or wax-based, making it easy and cost-effective to print new names.</li>\n<li><strong>Quick and Easy Customization</strong>: Simply print and slide in a new name, without the need for costly name badge printers or software.</li>\n<li><strong>Download Perforated Sheet Templates</strong>: Access templates to streamline the printing process.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Key Features</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Full-Color Printing</strong>: Enjoy vibrant, full-color printing on the metal part of the badge, ensuring your brand stands out.</li>\n<li><strong>Clear Plastic Cover</strong>: Protect the paper name insert with a clear plastic cover, maintaining a professional look.</li>\n<li><strong>Free Perforated A4 Sheets</strong>: Receive free perforated A4 sheets for your printer, making customization easy and convenient.</li>\n<li><strong>Pin or Magnetic Fittings</strong>: Choose between pin or magnetic fittings for easy attachment and versatility.</li>\n<li><strong>Rapid Production Times</strong>: Benefit from quick turnaround times, ensuring you receive your badges promptly.</li>\n<li><strong>No Setup Fees &amp; No Design Fees</strong>: Start your order without any additional setup or design costs.</li>\n<li><strong>Quantity-Based Prices</strong>: Enjoy competitive pricing with discounts based on order quantity.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Order Your Metal Reusable Window Badges Today!</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>Make a lasting impression with practical, stylish, and customizable name badges. Perfect for businesses, events, and organizations, these badges offer a professional look with the added benefit of reusability. Click the \"Add to Cart\" button and elevate your brand with our Metal Reusable Window Badges!</p>\n<p><strong><span data-teams=\"true\">To download printable sheet templates, please refer to the <a href=\"%%GLOBAL_ShopPathSSL%%/technical-guidelines/#namebadge-information\">technical guidelines</a> for name badges.</span></strong></p>"
